Description: |
  The composition root of the architecture: the `Minion`/`SMinion` and `Master`/`MWorker` daemon
  classes that call every salt/loader factory routine at startup and hold the resulting
  `LazyLoader` instances for the process lifetime. Deliberately scoped to minion.py/master.py
  only, not the rest of the salt/ directory (each subdirectory is its own cell in this forest).
